## Summary

**This code now correctly references:**
- `FILE5.xlsx` - Your T=3000K simulation data
- `FILE6.xlsx` - Your T=2500K simulation data  
- `FILE7.xlsx` - Your T=3000K extended simulation data

**When you run this in your directory, it will:**
1. Load your actual Excel files
2. Extract pressure, fugacity, and other columns where available
3. Generate publication-quality figures at 300 DPI
4. Use your real data where possible, theoretical curves where needed

**Just run the code as-is - it will find your files!**
